Package: darksoulsarmor
Type: Package
Title: Explore and Optimize Armor Combinations
Version: 1.0
Date: 2025-09-18
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", email = "package-maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    This package contains full datasets for the unupgraded and fully upgraded armor pieces of Dark Souls.
    It also has a function which can be used to produce a table of armor combinations with an associated score.
    This functionality is available in an interactive Shiny application.
